{
  "uid": "lab-tidb-demo",
  "title": "Lab — TiDB Demo App",
  "tags": ["lab", "tidb"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "About this demo",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## TiDB Demo — learning-path step 4\n\nEnd-to-end Vault secret injection into a Kubernetes pod:\n1. **Vault** holds `secret/tidb/demo` (seeded by `make vault-bootstrap`)\n2. **ExternalSecret** `tidb-demo-creds` renders it as a Kubernetes Secret in namespace `tidb`\n3. The **demo Deployment** mounts `TIDB_USER` / `TIDB_PASSWORD` from that Secret\n4. **Envoy Gateway** routes traffic via `http://tidb-demo.127.0.0.1.nip.io:8000`\n\n`make tidb-demo-up` · `make tidb-demo-down` · `make tidb-up` for a live TiDB cluster"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "stat", "title": "Demo Pod Running",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"tidb\", pod=~\"tidb-demo-.*\", phase=\"Running\"}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] },
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "Memory (MiB)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"tidb\", container=\"demo\"} / 1024 / 1024",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "timeseries", "title": "Memory usage",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"tidb\", container=\"demo\"}",
          "legendFormat": "memory",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5, "type": "timeseries", "title": "CPU usage",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
          "expr": "rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"tidb\", container=\"demo\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "cpu",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10 }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } }
    }
  ]
}

